           <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-spacing-base a-spacing-top-base a-divider-normal"/>   <h3 class="product-facts-title"> About this item </h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-small">  <li><span class="a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base">Sleek Rimless Rectangular Design: Dervin frameless rectangular sunglasses feature a modern and stylish design that adds a premium and sophisticated look for both men and women.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base">UV Protection Lenses: Equipped with UV-protected non-polarized lenses that help shield your eyes from harmful sun rays and provide comfortable vision in bright outdoor conditions.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base">Lightweight & Durable Construction: Crafted with high-quality materials and a strong frameless build for long-lasting durability and all-day comfort without pressure.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base">Perfect Size & Comfortable Fit: Medium Size | Frame Width: 138 mm | Lens Width: 53 mm | Lens Height: 35 mm | Bridge: 19 mm | Temple Length: 153 mm | Designed to fit most face shapes securely.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base">Ideal for Daily & Outdoor Use: Ideal for driving, traveling, shopping, beach outings, vacations, parties, and everyday lifestyle wear for men and women.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base">Warranty & Easy Care: Comes with 6-month Dervin manufacturer warranty and easy cleaning and storage instructions for long-lasting performance and customer satisfaction.</span></li>  </ul>     <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-spacing-base a-spacing-top-base a-divider-normal"/>    <h3 class="product-facts-title"> Additional Information </h3>    <div class="a-fixed-left-grid product-facts-detail"><div class="a-fixed-left-grid-inner" style="padding-left:140px"> <div class="a-fixed-left-grid-col a-col-left" style="width:140px;