         <div class="celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard" cel_widget_id="aplus-3p-module-b">
                  <div class="aplus-module-wrapper aplus-3p-fixed-width">
                                           <h3 class="a-spacing-mini"> Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses: Stylish, Modern Eyewear for Men and Women </h3>                                          <img alt="Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses: Stylish, Modern Eyewear for Men and Women" src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-spacing-base a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/a1ae03bf-0f2b-4a9b-aad8-238cd5621f17.__CR0,229,1200,742_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg"/><noscript><img alt="Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses: Stylish, Modern Eyewear for Men and Women" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/a1ae03bf-0f2b-4a9b-aad8-238cd5621f17.__CR0,229,1200,742_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg"/></noscript>                                         <h3 class="a-spacing-mini"> ABOUT DERVIN </h3>                                    <p class="a-spacing-base"> Our goal is to improve everyone&#039;s travel experience. To do this, we redefine avant-garde design concepts, introduce lens technology advancements, develop distinctive fashion philosophies, increase the irreplaceability of our goods, and establish a creative and humanistic worldwide group. We think we&#039;re bringing about a better existence. </p>     <p class="a-spacing-base"> By providing you excellent DERVIN eyewear, we help you enjoy your life. DERVIN shares in your most joyous times with you. When friends come together, they&#039;re pleased. Like how spending time with friends at the beach or trekking on a mountain with brothers makes for a more memorable day than spending time by yourself. Our lives are more enjoyable because we share our collective experiences. Embrace each joyful adventure. </p>     <p class="a-spacing-base"> Frustrated that you just dropped another expensive pair of sunglasses? Concerned about the outlooks&#039; brittle quality? Never pay too much again. With a significantly cheaper range but more performance, DERVIN gives you a better everyday wearing experience. </p>     <p class="a-spacing-base"> We continuously offer the most stylish, high-quality sunglasses available. Dervin is obsessed with leveraging creativity and design to make sunglasses that people genuinely adore. </p>    </div>
    </div>

