                  <div class="aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width">
   <div class="apm-spacing">
        <div class="apm-lefttwothirdswrap apm-floatleft">
            <div class="apm-leftimage">
                                                      <img alt="Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses: Stylish, Modern Eyewear for Men and Women" src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-spacing-mini a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/a1ae03bf-0f2b-4a9b-aad8-238cd5621f17.__CR0,0,1200,1200_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"/><noscript><img alt="Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses: Stylish, Modern Eyewear for Men and Women" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/a1ae03bf-0f2b-4a9b-aad8-238cd5621f17.__CR0,0,1200,1200_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"/></noscript>  </div>
            <div class="apm-centerthirdcol">
                                                       <h3 class="a-spacing-mini"> Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses: Stylish, Modern Eyewear for Men and Women </h3>                                          <h4 class="a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary"> Experience the latest in fashion with Dervin’s sleek and lightweight rectangular rimless sunglasses, designed for both men and women. </h4>                                    <p class="a-spacing-base"> The Dervin Rectangular Rimless Sunglasses for Men and Women are the latest in stylish eyewear. These sunglasses feature a sleek, modern design perfect for both genders. With a lightweight, rimless frame and rectangular lenses, they provide a sophisticated look. Ideal for various occasions, they blend contemporary style with comfort, making them the go-to choice for anyone seeking fashionable sunglasses for men and women. </p>     <p class="a-spacing-base"> 4o </p>                                                                                                                                            </div>
