                                   <div id="productDescription_feature_div" class="celwidget pd_rd_w-FjgBN pd_rd_r-G3A4165STD2SMYBE8HZ5 pd_rd_wg-ctOyQ" data-feature-name="productDescription"
                 data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-content-id="productDescription"
                 data-csa-c-slot-id="productDescription_feature_div" data-csa-c-asin=""
                 data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row="false">
                           <div>
      <div data-feature-name="productDescription" data-template-name="productDescription" id="productDescription_feature_div" class="a-row feature">    <div class="a-divider a-divider-section"><div class="a-divider-inner"></div></div>   <h2 class="softlines"> Product description  </h2>               <div id="productDescription" class="a-section a-spacing-small">       <!-- show up to 2 reviews by default -->
                   <p>    <span>Shield your eyes in style with the Dervin UV Protected Rimless Rectangular Sunglasses. Crafted to perfection, these sunglasses cater to both men and women who crave a blend of fashion and functionality. Designed without rims, these shades offer a sleek and modern look that complements various face shapes.</span><p><span> For men who value both fashion and eye protection, these sunglasses are a must-have accessory. The rimless design gives them a contemporary edge, perfect for casual outings or outdoor activities. The UV protection ensures your eyes stay safe from harmful sun rays while maintaining a clear vision.</span></p><p><span> Similarly, women can elevate their style game with these chic sunglasses. The rectangular shape adds a touch of sophistication, making them versatile enough to pair with any outfit. Whether it's a day at the beach or a city stroll, these sunglasses enhance your overall look while providing essential eye protection.</span></p><p><span> The rimless construction not only enhances the aesthetic appeal but also reduces weight, ensuring comfort during prolonged wear. The durable materials used in crafting these goggles guarantee longevity, making them a reliable choice for daily use.</span></p><p><span> With UV protection as a top priority, these sunglasses offer peace of mind knowing your eyes are shielded from UVA and UVB rays. Whether you're driving, participating in outdoor sports, or simply enjoying a sunny day, these sunglasses provide clarity and protection.</span></p><p><span> The Dervin UV Protected Rimless Rectangular Sunglasses are a fusion of style and functionality, catering to the fashion-conscious while prioritizing eye safety. Elevate your look and protect your eyes with these versatile and durable sunglasses for men and women.</span></p>    </p>          </div>  <style type="text/css">
